# Modular Experience Slices & Earthy Rhythms of Participation and Exchange

#>spw_modular_experience_slices_volleyball
#:review #!architecture #!collaboration #!ontology
#:layer #!pragmatics

@css_alignment: ~"./css-architecture-alignment.spw"
@spw_css_architecture_plan: ~"../../.agents/plans/spw-css-architecture/PLAN.md"
